  <Metadata Title="Bloodborne" Name="Sprint Fix (High FPS)" Note="Fixes sprint dropping to half speed above ~147 FPS (and at random moments above ~90 FPS). Use together with Uncap FPS++ or 90 FPS++. The game's wall detector measured distance per frame (a 30 FPS rule); this makes it measure speed instead." Author="yogesh1239" PatchVer="1.0" AppVer="01.09" AppElf="eboot.bin" isEnabled="true">
